label: Restaurant Master
description: 'Trusted master record of every physical restaurant of a quick-service group (three brands, US and Canada) across its lifecycle, from pipeline site to closure: public-facing data, lifecycle, operator and franchisee, organization alignments and each system''s identifiers. Fed by Real Estate, ERP and the brand POS systems, completed by business stewards, consumed by HR, delivery apps, websites and map listings.'
